// runtime functions.
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

/// RUNTIME_GREYLISTED(Name)
///   Lists Name as one of the functions available in the uSwift runtime.
///   Greylisted functions must exist in the uSwift runtime but are not realtime safe (e.g. malloc or locking).

///   If a runtime function starts with swift_ and is not listed on the white list
///   then the compiler will emit an error just before bitcode emission to say the function is not supported.

///   If the function is listed here then it's use in a realtime context causes an error.
///   Realtime can be enabled for the whole compile by default (disabled per function using @norealtime)
///   or just enabled per function (when realtime is not enabled for the whole compile) using @realtime.

RUNTIME_GREYLISTED(swift_slowAlloc)
RUNTIME_GREYLISTED(swift_slowDealloc)
